ad who becomes a vampire  herself  and joining helsing the organization  uncovers a plot of apocalyptic  proportions that threatens the world  amazing animation great fights  unrelenting violence  some of the best showcases of powers in  anime  what more could you ask for in a fantasy  horror series helsing is one of the most  popular series of the genre it's  something better watched than red  so go ahead and start watching it now  standing in our runner-up spot in second  place is berserk  when it comes to horror and unrestrained  violence i find few shows capable of  holding a candle to berserk in that  regard of course i'm talking about the  1997 berserk not the recent one that had  its fair share of online popcorn berserk  is the story of  guts an orphan who embraces the  battlefield  fighting for his life day after day his  life takes a huge turn after his run-in  with the band of the hawk a mercenary  group led by the charismatic griffith  joining the group as a formidable new  ally gutz quickly realizes the world  isn't as simple as he thought it was  after all bloodshed and strength aren't  everything in this grim world what more  needs to be said about berserk starring  one of the most  badass and outright brutal protagonists  out there there is a reason  why the series has become a classic that  stood the test of time do take note  though the anime does have some heavy  modifications in order to tone down the  violence but i think  it's a decent adaptation overall unlike  the latest one  topping off yet another list is parasite  [Applause]  i think when it comes to combining  action and its signature style of body  horror few titles can come close to  parasite for those of you who don't know  about the series parasite is basically a  show about an alien invasion only this  time they don't come  in spaceships or look like those green  or grey men we've come to know aliens  for instead these  organisms come in the form of parasites  that latch onto humans and possess them  turning them into transformative  monsters with an appetite  for human flesh thankfully our  protagonist shinichi was able to stop a  hostile takeover but in exchange  said parasite gets stuck in his hand the  parasite called migi comes to life as  his transforming hand and the duo gets  forced to put aside their differences in  order to survive the crapsack world  where fellow parasites are on the hunt  for them combining  philosophical themes some serious  violence high octane action  and some really funky music parasite is  probably one of the shows that i'd  eagerly blindly recommend to someone who  hasn't watched anime at all i think that  after all of these years  the original story from the manga that's  over three decades old  still holds up strongly definitely put  this on your watch list  if you want to watch some action horror  anime  well i guess that's more than enough  anime for you to enjoy in the upcoming  halloween week  which ones are you most excited about  which ones have you already seen  and how did you find them please share  your thoughts and sentiments down in the  comment section below and we can have  fun chatting about anime and other cool  things too  now before i end the video i'd like to  give a shout out to the sponsors of this  video  lazy moods they offer a variety of these  amazing lamps from anime like naruto  hunter hunter attack on titan and loads  more each led lamp has a variety of  colors and is remote controlled  currently they're offering 50 discount  plus free shipping  which is ending soon so make sure you  don't miss it you can also use my code  vinnie for an additional 10 discount my  personal favorite one is the attack on  titan lamp but i also love this thousand  sunny one i mean just look how  incredible these look this is something  really unique so make sure you check it  out the links in the description before  i go i'd like to once again  encourage you to subscribe and hit the  bell button on you